      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Drill Deeper",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "manipulate"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements Nils Kelveken hit a creature with a hand drill Strike with his previous action\n\n---\n\nEffect Nils grabs the drill and twists, drilling deeper into the victim. He automatically deals 1d8 piercing damage, and the creature being drilled into must succeed at a DC 22 Fortitude save save to avoid taking an additional 1d6 bleed (2d6 bleed on a critical failure)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "I See What Ye Did!",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "linguistic",
        "mental",
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Nils Strides up to his speed toward a target within 30 feet, shrieking \"I seen what ye did!\" at them as he approaches. The target must attempt a DC 22 Will save save.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The target is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The target becomes disturbed at what Nils might have seen and becomes Frightened 1.\n\nFailure As success, but the target is Frightened 2.\n\nCritical Failure The target falls into a phantasmagoric nightmare state where time seems to slow down as they can think of nothing but running away, yet as fast as they try to flee, Nils can catch up with ease. The target is Slowed 2 at the start of its next turn and Fleeing until the end of its next turn."
    }
  ]
